OL,3,AUK diesel prices top #2 a litre for
OL,4,Afirst time, RAC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average price of diesel has risen
OL,7,Fabove #2 a litre in the UK for the
OL,8,Ffirst time, according to the RAC
OL,9,Fmotoring group.
OL,11,FDiesel has now hit an average of
OL,12,F200.01p a litre, the RAC said, and
OL,13,Fpetrol prices are also still rising,
OL,14,Freaching 174.71p a litre on average.
OL,16,FThe motoring group said price rises
OL,17,Fwere "showing no signs of slowing,
OL,18,Fheaping more misery onto motorists".
