OL,3,AUK diesel prices top #2 a litre for
OL,4,Afirst time, RAC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,7,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,8,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,9,Fwholesale oil and refined products from
OL,10,Fthe region, causing prices to surge
OL,11,Fworldwide.
